sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Platform as KServe / ModelMesh<br/>Platform Routing
    participant Auth as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>ASGI Middleware
    participant API as FastAPI Server<br/>OpenAI-compatible API
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>CPU Inference
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Local as Local Model Storage

    Note over Engine,HF: Model Loading (Startup)
    alt Online Mode (HF_HUB_OFFLINE=0)
        Engine->>HF: GET model weights & tokenizers<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS
        HF-->>Engine: Model artifacts
    else Disconnected Mode (HF_HUB_OFFLINE=1)
        Engine->>Local: Load pre-cached model<br/>Local filesystem
        Local-->>Engine: Model artifacts + tiktoken tokenizers
    end

    Note over Client,Engine: HTTP Inference Flow
    Client->>Platform: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Platform->>Auth: Forward request<br/>Platform routing
    alt API Key configured (VLLM_API_KEY set)
        Auth->>Auth: Validate Bearer token<br/>SHA-256 constant-time compare
        alt Token valid
            Auth->>API: Forward authenticated request
        else Token invalid
            Auth-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
    else No API Key configured
        Auth->>API: Pass through (no auth)
    end
    API->>Engine: Submit inference request<br/>EngineClient protocol
    Engine->>Engine: CPU inference processing
    alt Streaming response
        Engine-->>API: SSE stream chunks
        API-->>Platform: SSE stream
        Platform-->>Client: Server-Sent Events
    else Non-streaming response
        Engine-->>API: JSON result
        API-->>Platform: JSON response
        Platform-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    Note over Client,Engine: Health Check Flow (Unauthenticated)
    Client->>API: GET /health, /ready, /readyz
    API-->>Client: 200 OK (no auth required)

    Note over Client,Engine: gRPC Inference Flow
    participant GClient as gRPC Client
    participant GRPC as gRPC Server<br/>Port 50051<br/>Insecure
    participant GEngine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>(gRPC instance)

    GClient->>GRPC: VllmEngine RPC<br/>HTTP/2, No TLS
    GRPC->>GEngine: Submit inference
    GEngine-->>GRPC: Inference result
    GRPC-->>GClient: gRPC response

    GClient->>GRPC: grpc.health.v1.Health.Check<br/>Health probe
    GRPC-->>GClient: SERVING status
